---
// AboutSection — Rams pull-quote + restrained bio.
---

<section id="about" class="about section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quote-block">
      <span class="micro attribution-label">Principle 10 — Dieter Rams</span>

      <blockquote class="quote">
        <h2 class="quote-text">Less, but better.</h2>
        <cite class="quote-cite">— Dieter Rams</cite>
      </blockquote>

      <span class="quote-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm finishing a CS degree at the University of Ottawa in May 2027. Born in
        2004. Most of the projects on this page began with a practical problem. I
        thought through how to build a solution and then did the work. Some became
        useful tools; others taught me what to build next.
      </p>

      <p>
        My first language was C, learned across grade 11 and 12. I wrote a
        command-line ATM program that got as far as pointers and file I/O, and a
        top-down shooter on an Arduino board with an OLED screen, a joystick, four
        buttons, and a piezo buzzer. Neither of those is a project I'm proudest of.
        They're the ones that made me want to keep going.
      </p>

      <p>
        I 3D print, run a homelab, and keep local AI models running on available
        hardware. The AI and embedded work I'm
        proud of is mostly self-taught — I read datasheets and source before I read
        tutorials. Since 2020 I've been the technical support person at my family's
        janitorial company, which includes running payroll for fifty people in
        QuickBooks and maintaining the dispatch system. I spent a term on
        Solace's support team maintaining the tooling. Before that I built PyQt
        tools for radar analysis at the Communications Research Center, and
        prototyped Power BI dashboards for HR directors at Infrastructure Canada
        over the summer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .quote-block {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .attribution-label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .quote-cite {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-subtle);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .quote-rule {
    display: block;
    width: 48px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 38rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
